OL,3,APhilippine rescuers board ferry 40
OL,4,Ahours after blaze began
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 40 hours after a deadly ferry
OL,7,Ffire began, Philippine rescuers have
OL,8,Fboarded the charred remains of the MV
OL,9,FJune Aster in search of dozens of
OL,10,Fmissing people.
OL,12,FFive people been found dead, while 43
OL,13,Fpeople have been rescued, many of whom
OL,14,Fare receiving treatment in hospital.
OL,15,FEighty-four people remain missing.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
