OL,3,APhilippine rescuers board ferry 40
OL,4,Ahours after blaze began
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhotos shared by the Philippine Coast
OL,7,FGuard on Friday morning showed smoke
OL,8,Fstill curling from the ferry, which had
OL,9,Fbeen travelling from the capital Manila
OL,10,Fto the island of Coron - though the
OL,11,Fplumes appear to have died down in
OL,12,Ffresh photos from Friday afternoon.
OL,14,FOfficials struggled to board the hull
OL,15,Fsince operations began on Wednesday
OL,16,Fbecause of the toxic fumes and heat.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
